{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-02-08 14:22:00', 'title': "WORK UNDERWAY TO UPGRADE, EXPAND PENN POWER'S ELECTRIC SYSTEM IN BUTLER COUNTY TO SUPPORT AREA'S RAPID GROWTH", 'text': "CRANBERRY, PA., FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PENN POWER, A FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) ELECTRIC COMPANY, IS UPGRADING AND EXPANDING ITS POWER SYSTEM IN BUTLER COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA, TO SUPPORT THE FUTURE ENERGY DEMANDS OF THE AREA'S RAPIDLY GROWING POPULATION AND HELP PREVENT LENGTHY SERVICE DISRUPTIONS DURING SEVERE WEATHER."}